{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人戴祖儀一向愛古靈精怪，近日佢染咗一頭粉紅色頭髮，上載一輯索相，只見佢身穿淺藍色長袖恤衫，配搭黑色皮褸，黑色絲襪上陣，更腳踏帶有珍珠裝飾嘅黑色高踭鞋，保留隨性學院風格，展現標誌性修長美腿，睇到大家流鼻血。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.209581+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T04:01:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"32dcb562ef81dc9b95670ab84204bace1dd68b9af99e0e8a89eba6cc8d4cf7fe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}